@startuml cu26
!theme plain
title CU26 — Ingresar nuevo tipo de trámite

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to register a new procedure type.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (Name; Whether registration is required; Whether it is archived; Whether it is linked to properties; Notes; Document list)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) enters the requested data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Records the entered data and creates a new procedure type.
System -> System : System

@enduml